  "notes": "Released as a preview together with DeepSeek-V4-Pro (the web chat offered V4 via Expert Mode and Instant Mode; which model serves which mode is not stated). The legacy API names deepseek-chat and deepseek-reasoner routed to its non-thinking and thinking modes from 2026-04-24; DeepSeek announced they would be retired after 2026-07-24, 15:59 UTC (news post; the change log says discontinued on 2026-07-24). Parameter count: 284B in the Hugging Face card, the API news post and the report; 285B in the V4 model card PDF. The DeepSeek-V4-Flash-DSpark repository is the same checkpoint with a speculative decoding module attached, not a new model (its card says so)."
